  "prefLabel": "Phy 401.11 Federation of State Boards of Physical Therapy (FSBPT)",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Phy 401.11 “Federation of State Boards of Physical Therapy (FSBPT)” means the entity that develops the national examination for physical therapists and physical therapist assistants.\n\nSource. #9456, eff 4-17-09; renumbered by #10061 (from Phy 401.08); ss by #12088, eff 1-20-17",
